        {
          "book": "JOB",
          "chapter": 14,
          "verse": 4
        }
      ],
      "en": "Who can bring a clean thing out of an unclean? Not one.",
      "ko": "누가 깨끗한 것을 더러운 것 가운데서 낼수 있으리이까 하나도 없나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "0b003f50a7dd3e6102cbd46d828cc261d44b4e18607e85bc06f543ee7a80fe5d",
      "translation_text_hash": "db52404001ffb465f22dc3318cea78c1e653309f94d777e6c10eca118ff9b345",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "누가 깨끗한 것을 더러운 것 가운데서 낼수 있으리이까 하나도 없나이다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "db52404001ffb465f22dc3318cea78c1e653309f94d777e6c10eca118ff9b345"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:JOB:14:5",
      "sequence": 13187,
      "chapter_label": "JOB 14",
      "verse_label": "5",
      "locator": {
        "book": "JOB",
